  },
  {
    "id": "0d9ddeed17fa49d0b0f53f1291c4277d",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": "Average user made 13712.62 actions in the observed period."
  },
  {
    "id": "63182cf7c46d42968cf431e8fa683b57",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": "## Mean actions by user in a day"
  },
  {
    "id": "663c325bc489419a9fd26562e8a80942",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": "df.groupby(['user_id', df['action_time'].dt.date]).size().mean()",
    "execution_count": 359
  },
  {
    "id": "e86b8ec1e2b74ec5b7cc61ddf94a195d",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": "Average user made about 28.5 actions per day in the observed period."
  },
  {
    "id": "128042137df74ae79103949dfa92382e",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": "## The probability of repeating the same action three times in a row during one session"
  },
  {
    "id": "7fb03cd50c5e4df99e750bfe77083301",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": "## The 0.95 quantile of distribution of time delta between the actions of the same type distribution during one session"
  },
  {
    "id": "fdb6e86fae424b7b82e76e511a555973",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": "## Is there statistical difference of activity in different days of the week?"
  },
  {
    "id": "2d53bf87d5024194aad8127d8661e91e",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": "df['date'] = df['action_time'].dt.date\ndf['day_of_week'] = df['action_time'].dt.dayofweek",
    "execution_count": 372
  },
  {
    "id": "6fe9ef1c905f41a08b807b21caa9ad64",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": "For testing statistical difference of activity in different days of the week we can use ANOVA test with H0 of no significant difference. We assume general things to use ANOVA ((1) interval data of the dependent variable, (2) normality, (3) homoscedasticity, and (4) no multicollinearity)\n\nFirst we calculate for each day of the week the number of occurances."
  },
  {
    "id": "1e06484d61494397848ca969d2d012f1",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": "data = pd.crosstab(df['day_of_week'], df.groupby(['day_of_week'])['date'].rank(method='dense').astype(int))\ndata",
    "execution_count": 380
  },
  {
    "id": "4945b7a08ef04f1581d79e0586fd2928",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": "f_statistic, p_value = stats.f_oneway(data.iloc[0].to_list(),data.iloc[1].to_list(),data.iloc[2].to_list(),data.iloc[3].to_list(),data.iloc[4].to_list(),data.iloc[5].to_list(), data.iloc[6].to_list())\n\nprint(\"p-value:\", p_value)",
    "execution_count": 394
  },
  {
    "id": "e9893c12e0834ab3b19296deea9c38a0",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": "In this case, the p-value is great, so we cannot reject the null hypothesis that there is no significant difference between the means of the groups. This means that there is insufficient evidence to support the claim that the groups are different from one another."
  },
  {
    "id": "041c2d8ebf414be0a091805d56adc495",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": "To illustrate the test, we can plot the distribution among the days of the week."
  },
  {
    "id": "f5b5fe8035ed48bf97216e0e8d6ecf53",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": "data.T.boxplot()",
    "execution_count": 395
  },
  {
    "id": "69ed43c408534f3d8b439c4a83253f6c",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": "## And between weekends and workdays? "
  },
  {
    "id": "bb034e6edb674145843e29b86e3f12b2",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": "We can use t-test, assuming homogeneity and normality."
  },
  {
    "id": "fec4fc109d374cc3b4505c4c9689b439",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": "t_stat, p_val = stats.ttest_ind(data.iloc[0].to_list()+data.iloc[1].to_list()+data.iloc[2].to_list()+data.iloc[3].to_list()+data.iloc[4].to_list(),data.iloc[5].to_list()+data.iloc[6].to_list())\nprint(\"p-value:\", p_val)",
    "execution_count": 397
  },
  {
    "id": "c860ea1119dd419e86ad17dbc7c95dda",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": "The p-value is great, so we cannot reject the null hypothesis that there is no significant difference between weekends and weekdays."
  },
  {
    "id": "3d490f41d7044f16a05964fa9d26f7fd",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": "## Some additional metrics"
  },
  {
    "id": "ded5dd6bc43943b78f9451bd570ad603",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": "Some additional mertics may include analyzing the duration of the sessions."
