  {
    "id": "d59e1019880541a288703fe015234a43",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": "### Is there statistical difference of activity in different days of the week? And between weekends and workdays?"
  },
  {
    "id": "07532fb237fc458dab972e898f005c17",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": "!pip install statsmodels\n!pip install scipy",
    "execution_count": null
  },
  {
    "id": "d28df71f6e774b988b91ec5084be942c",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": "from statsmodels.stats.proportion import proportion_confint\n\ndf['dow'] = df['action_time'].dt.dayofweek\nres = df.groupby('dow').size().reset_index().rename(columns={0:'count'})\ntotal = res['count'].sum()\nres[['ci_lo', 'ci_hi']] = res['count'].apply(lambda x: pd.Series(proportion_confint(x, total)))\nres.sort_values('ci_lo', ascending=False)",
    "execution_count": null
  },
  {
    "id": "bb9adf4c7abd416e936511389e75855e",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": "Comparing weekdays, there is significantly higher activity on Sunday than on any other weekday\n"
  },
  {
    "id": "1211d1cb2a83456f8fa4e76240c7e58e",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": "from statsmodels.stats.proportion import binom_test\n\ndf['is_weekend'] = df['dow'] >= 5\nres = df.groupby('is_weekend').size().reset_index().rename(columns={0:'count'})\nctr = res.loc[res['is_weekend'], 'count'].iloc[0]\n\np_value = 0.05\np_res = binom_test(ctr, total, prop=2/7)\np_res > p_value\n",
    "execution_count": null
  },
  {
    "id": "edeb295df864446e8eef94fac3f19809",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": "Comparing weekends vs weekdays, there is no significant difference. High activity on Sunday is compensated by low activity on Saturday.\n"
  },
