  {
    "id": "e7ad793eecb14a3f882883379807bd0c",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": "### Mean actions by user in a day"
  },
  {
    "id": "2aaa1b6484314aac9738db69dca37317",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": "df['action_date'] = df['action_time'].dt.date\nans = df.groupby(['user_id', 'action_date']).size().mean()\nprint(ans)",
    "execution_count": 11
  },
  {
    "id": "eaf7b08bfcaf4bf59bc58111596d5b25",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": "### The probability of repeating the same action three times in a row during one session"
  },
  {
    "id": "8042639d07d24d7fbe9a4d48047235d8",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": "total = len(data)\nk = 0\nfor uid, actions in data:\n    for i in range(len(actions) - 2):\n        a_name = actions[i][0]\n        if a_name == actions[i+1][0] and a_name == actions[i+2][0]:\n            k += 1\n#             print(actions[i:i+3])\n            break\nans = k / total\nprint(ans)",
    "execution_count": 12
  },
  {
    "id": "6e271405fd4f450994a6f5703745a31d",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": "### The 0.95 quantile of distribution of time delta between the actions of the same type during one session"
  },
  {
    "id": "933c6e93e31a451b921bb929e4cacc6c",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": "deltas = []\nis_found = False\nfor uid, actions in data:\n    history = {}\n    for a_name, a_time in actions:\n        if a_name in history:\n            d = (a_time - history[a_name]).seconds\n            deltas.append(d)\n        history[a_name] = a_time\n# len(deltas)",
    "execution_count": 13
  },
  {
    "id": "3c30e8dda1e54ac78a6ba1a73749bc49",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": "ans = np.quantile(deltas, 0.95)\nprint(f'The 0.95 quantile is {ans} sec')",
    "execution_count": 14
  },
  {
    "id": "ed4396f1f5ab450e8194f11746404c19",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": "### Is there statistical difference of activity in different days of the week? And between weekends and workdays?"
  },
  {
    "id": "0394943b5d1346f68b63d1ba45fd093d",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": "!pip install statsmodels\n!pip install scipy",
    "execution_count": 15
  },
  {
    "id": "00e3d54d43d24126a1a88a86ca90741f",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": "from statsmodels.stats.proportion import proportion_confint\n\ndf['dow'] = df['action_time'].dt.dayofweek\nres = df.groupby('dow').size().reset_index().rename(columns={0:'count'})\ntotal = res['count'].sum()\nres[['ci_lo', 'ci_hi']] = res['count'].apply(lambda x: pd.Series(proportion_confint(x, total)))\nres.sort_values('ci_lo', ascending=False)",
    "execution_count": 16
  },
  {
    "id": "6fb38ec463694af783086268a355a143",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": "Comparing weekdays, there is significantly higher activity on Sunday than on any other weekday\n"
  },
  {
    "id": "dc185809c9b24a6483cf44363ed41425",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": "from statsmodels.stats.proportion import binom_test\n\ndf['is_weekend'] = df['dow'] >= 5\nres = df.groupby('is_weekend').size().reset_index().rename(columns={0:'count'})\nctr = res.loc[res['is_weekend'], 'count'].iloc[0]\n\np_value = 0.05\np_res = binom_test(ctr, total, prop=2/7)\np_res > p_value\n",
    "execution_count": 17
  },
  {
    "id": "16ccbe8429534493833a99b87117ef2f",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": "Comparing weekends vs weekdays, there is no significant difference. High activity on Sunday is compensated by low activity on Saturday.\n"
  },
  {
